log log_langevin.lammps
units lj
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data initial.data
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff 1 1 1.0 1.0
pair_modify shift yes tail no
neighbor 0.3 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 0.005
fix integrate all nve
fix thermostat all langevin 1.0 1.0 0.5 12345
thermo 10
thermo_style custom step time pe ke etotal temp
thermo_modify norm no format float %.17g
compute_modify thermo_temp extra/dof 0
dump trajectory all custom 100 lammps_langevin.dump id x y z vx vy vz
dump_modify trajectory sort id format float %.17g
run 10000
